ows and fear a Day whose evil will be widespread.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":7,"sd":null},{"k":"76:8","t":"And they give food in spite of love for it to the needy, the orphan, and the captive,","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":8,"sd":null},{"k":"76:9","t":"[Saying], \"We feed you only for the face [i.e., approval] of Allāh. We wish not from you reward or gratitude.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"76:10","t":"Indeed, We fear from our Lord a Day austere and distressful.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"76:11","t":"So Allāh will protect them from the evil of that Day and give them radiance and happiness","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"76:12","t":"And will reward them for what they patiently endured [with] a garden [in Paradise] and silk [garments].","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"76:13","t":"[They will be] reclining therein on adorned couches. They will not see therein any [burning] sun or [freezing] cold.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"76:14","t":"And near above them are its shades, and its [fruit] to be picked will be lowered in compliance.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"76:15","t":"And there will be circulated among them vessels of silver and cups having been [created] clear [as glass],","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"76:16","t":"Clear glasses [made] from silver of which they have determined the measure.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"76:17","t":"And they will be given to drink a cup [of wine] whose mixture is of ginger","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"76:18","t":"[From] a fountain within it [i.e., Paradise] named Salsabeel.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"76:19","t":"There will circulate among them young boys made eternal. When you see them, you would think them [as beautiful as] scattered pearls.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"76:20","t":"And when you look there [in Paradise], you will see pleasure and great dominion.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"76:21","t":"Upon them [i.e., the inhabitants] will be green garments of fine silk and brocade. And they will be adorned with bracelets of silver, and their Lord will give them a purifying drink.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"76:22","t":"[And it will be said], \"Indeed, this is for you a reward, and your effort has been appreciated.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"76:23","t":"Indeed, it is We who have sent down to you, [O Muḥammad], the Qur’ān progressively.","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"76:24","t":"So be patient for the decision of your Lord and do not obey from among them a sinner or ungrateful [disbeliever].","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"76:25","t":"And mention the name of your Lord [in prayer] morning and evening","j":29,"h":58,"s":76,"a":25,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[76],"sajdah":false}